        "cooked": "<p>It might not be a bug.</p><blockquote><p>If that power deals damage, increase that damage by 2.</p></blockquote><p>That's a conditional static effect.</p><p>If \"that damage\" refers to damage dealt by the power you select, then it is working properly. &nbsp;While Hasty Augmentation is in play, damage dealt by the selected power will be increased by 2.</p><p>That's how I think it should work, because \"that damage\" refers to damage dealt by \"that power\".</p><p>It's also thematically cool that Unity can be amazing with Omnitron-U in a way that seems broken, because she built him.</p><p>Need to get a second OX deck and play out his incap.</p>",
